Subject: Cantor Temporal Planner and Bidirectional Change Reflection

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a Planner-forward, Calendar-bound, repository-preserved, rear-reviewed, Observer-admitted ChangeCapsule walk and its bidirectional compiler correspondence. It permits only a separately claimed pure machine-form implementation slice; it grants no runtime, live clock, provider, calendar synchronization, notification, background journal, Git mutation, concurrent-agent, model-training, desktop, FPGA, or external-effect authority.

